---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---
<Layout title="About - StudyHelp" description="StudyHelp offers chapter-wise FAQs and MCQs for TSPSC, TS Police, and other competitive exam preparation in English, Telugu, and Hindi.">

  <Header active="about" />

  <div class="content">
    <h1>About StudyHelp</h1>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
      StudyHelp is built for competitive exam aspirants who want clear, chapter-wise FAQs and MCQs to prepare with, without wading through long articles or scattered notes.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
      Our content spans Telangana state government exams like TSPSC Group 1, Group 2, Group 3, Group 4, and TS Police SI and Constable recruitment, alongside broader competitive exam subjects like Quantitative Aptitude and Indian Polity. Content is available in English, Telugu, and Hindi, with more subjects added regularly. Visit the <a href="https://studyhelp.fdaytalk.com/subjects/">Subjects page</a> to see everything currently live.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:16px;">
      Every subject is organized chapter by chapter, with FAQs and MCQs written to match the level of detail these exams actually test. Reading starts free, no login needed. Once you have explored enough to know the content is useful, subjects can be unlocked for unlimited access with a one-time payment, no subscription.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; color:var(--muted);">
      Questions or feedback? Visit our <a href="https://studyhelp.fdaytalk.com/contact/">Contact page</a>, or check the Plans page for pricing details.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>